WEBVTT

00:10.010 --> 00:12.429
INTERROGATION IN PROGRESS

00:21.354 --> 00:23.773
Your handbag was found in the sewer.

00:25.400 --> 00:27.610
Even the tattoo on her ankle
matches yours.

00:37.120 --> 00:39.581
You disguised the body as Sarah Kim.

00:39.664 --> 00:40.498
No, I mean,

00:41.583 --> 00:43.293
you perfectly disguised it as you

00:43.960 --> 00:46.004
and slipped off the suspect list.

00:48.381 --> 00:51.009
All the evidence points toward you.

00:55.680 --> 00:58.767
People think what they want to believe
is the truth.

00:59.893 --> 01:02.187
Just because the evidence points to me

01:02.854 --> 01:05.398
doesn't mean I killed anyone.

01:09.194 --> 01:12.238
And yet, you believe I'm the killer.

01:15.992 --> 01:17.535
I know nothing about this.

01:18.620 --> 01:22.874
If you're not the perpetrator,
you must feel this situation is unfair.

01:25.168 --> 01:27.212
How would you feel if it were you?

01:27.295 --> 01:28.671
I'd want to prove myself.

01:29.172 --> 01:30.173
How about it?

01:30.673 --> 01:32.550
Can you prove yourself?

01:33.885 --> 01:35.762
I would've already if I could.

01:36.471 --> 01:37.388
What if you could?

01:39.099 --> 01:44.187
What if there's a way to prove who you are
and whether you're the killer or not?

01:46.981 --> 01:50.360
Do you consent to providing a DNA sample?

02:22.600 --> 02:24.686
THE ART OF SARAH

02:27.147 --> 02:30.608
UNREGISTERED PERSON

02:32.735 --> 02:35.405
Apparently, no DNA from the crime scene
matches hers.

02:35.989 --> 02:37.448
That goes for prints too.

02:37.949 --> 02:39.659
How is this even possible?

02:42.996 --> 02:44.914
- She was smiling.
- What?

02:45.456 --> 02:49.043
Do you consent to providing a DNA sample?

02:57.385 --> 03:00.096
She knew we wouldn't be able
to prove anything,

03:01.264 --> 03:03.099
as she had no identity to begin with.

03:05.059 --> 03:08.521
How can we have a victim and a suspect
and not know who they are?

03:09.606 --> 03:11.566
Can unregistered people even exist?

03:11.649 --> 03:13.860
There are always blind spots.

03:14.444 --> 03:17.989
That means there are no existing records.

03:18.072 --> 03:20.325
That means we might have to track down

03:21.034 --> 03:25.205
a person who exists but doesn't exist
within 34 hours.

03:25.288 --> 03:27.749
- But that means--
- It's impossible.

03:27.832 --> 03:31.127
Only the suspect's statement
will provide the missing pieces.

03:31.628 --> 03:34.172
The suspect was certain
we wouldn't find any evidence.

03:34.255 --> 03:35.548
She'll never cooperate.

03:39.052 --> 03:40.595
What if we use that certainty?

03:42.388 --> 03:44.224
She can get rid of evidence,

03:45.308 --> 03:47.602
but she can't erase
the tracks she left doing it.

03:48.603 --> 03:49.687
Yes, sir.

03:55.485 --> 03:56.778
What's going on here?

03:57.278 --> 04:00.031
Lee is in charge now. You're off the case.

04:00.114 --> 04:01.115
Sir!

04:01.199 --> 04:04.953
The warrant is likely to be denied
if we can't find evidence by tomorrow.

04:05.036 --> 04:06.955
And you know what's next.

04:08.831 --> 04:12.335
You'll have a disciplinary hearing
for making an unlawful arrest.

04:12.418 --> 04:13.753
Take responsibility.

04:13.836 --> 04:15.755
No, but I'm not done yet.

04:15.838 --> 04:17.465
I can solve this in time.

04:19.217 --> 04:22.637
It's the incompetent ones
who think they can actually do something.

04:25.390 --> 04:26.724
Get inside.

04:26.808 --> 04:27.767
If you do this,

04:29.143 --> 04:31.562
you'll single-handedly ruin
the entire case!

04:32.063 --> 04:36.234
I know you pushed ahead with that arrest
out of blind ambition.

04:36.317 --> 04:37.443
Get out of my way.

04:37.944 --> 04:40.989
Instead of holding your men back
to save your ass.

04:41.781 --> 04:42.699
Go inside.

05:08.850 --> 05:09.934
Sir!

05:12.729 --> 05:14.188
There you are.

05:15.648 --> 05:17.317
Sarah Kim is refusing to talk.

05:18.151 --> 05:20.111
She says she'll only talk to you.

05:26.284 --> 05:27.201
You're back.

05:32.081 --> 05:33.499
Let's take a break.

05:42.967 --> 05:46.679
Why do you look trapped
when I'm the one who's locked up?

05:49.349 --> 05:53.603
I know what you're going through,
trying to hang on. I've been there.

05:56.064 --> 06:00.526
Doors that open easily for others
have often seemed like walls to me.

06:01.194 --> 06:02.987
I'd feel robbed in those moments

06:03.696 --> 06:05.948
when things were never even mine.

06:12.121 --> 06:14.040
It's the world that's messed up,

06:14.540 --> 06:16.000
not you, Detective.

06:21.589 --> 06:22.632
Wow.

06:24.175 --> 06:25.885
I thought you were being sincere.

06:27.136 --> 06:30.973
Is this how you've been fooling
all those people until now?

06:31.599 --> 06:33.893
By exploiting their vulnerabilities?

06:35.853 --> 06:39.232
Do you know what kinds of people
con artists usually target?

06:39.899 --> 06:40.942
Stupid people?

06:41.025 --> 06:42.693
Incredibly vain people?

06:43.194 --> 06:47.031
No. If anything, they're intellectuals
with expert knowledge.

06:47.532 --> 06:49.242
The more expert they are,

06:49.742 --> 06:52.203
the more adamantly they believe
they can't be fooled.

06:55.456 --> 06:57.333
Be careful. I'm talking about you.

07:00.253 --> 07:01.337
Let's get started.

07:05.675 --> 07:07.593
- Start recording.
- Yes, sir.

07:08.469 --> 07:11.556
You were last seen at the Boudoir party.

07:11.639 --> 07:15.268
You cut off all contact
and disappeared after that.

07:15.351 --> 07:16.519
Where were you?

07:17.019 --> 07:19.480
I went to Samwol right after the party.

07:19.981 --> 07:22.900
I had to get the shop ready
for the February opening.

07:22.984 --> 07:24.152
Are you sure?

07:25.736 --> 07:28.823
I finished at 10:00 a.m.
and went straight to the hotel.

07:29.365 --> 07:31.159
You can check my dashcam footage.

07:32.535 --> 07:34.370
Wasn't it a bit early to check in?

07:34.454 --> 07:35.955
I'm an extended-stay guest.

07:36.038 --> 07:37.290
And after that?

07:38.291 --> 07:41.502
I wanted some quiet time alone,
so I stayed in with my phone off

07:42.003 --> 07:43.838
until I met you yesterday.

07:44.589 --> 07:46.883
They'll have a record
of my room service orders.

07:50.845 --> 07:52.430
What a perfect alibi.

07:54.140 --> 07:55.057
Is it?

07:56.392 --> 07:58.227
If I had told you sooner,

07:58.311 --> 08:00.938
I could've saved us both a lot of trouble.

08:09.572 --> 08:11.574
She's just trifling with us, isn't she?

08:13.868 --> 08:16.787
Sarah Kim's statement conflicts
with someone else's.

08:17.288 --> 08:18.164
Who do you mean?

08:18.664 --> 08:19.540
Choi Chae-u!

08:19.624 --> 08:21.334
The lease agreement in question

08:21.417 --> 08:24.337
was reviewed and deemed invalid
by our MD Team.

08:24.837 --> 08:28.883
We've already addressed the issue
by disciplining the employee responsible,

08:28.966 --> 08:30.635
per our internal regulations.

08:31.135 --> 08:32.261
So I was told.

08:41.187 --> 08:43.481
It means one of them is lying.

08:44.565 --> 08:47.818
See if the store construction has started,
then come right over.

08:48.319 --> 08:49.153
Yes, sir.

08:56.786 --> 08:57.954
2024 KEF NEW YEAR'S PARTY

08:58.037 --> 08:59.455
Distinguished members

08:59.956 --> 09:02.708
and esteemed guests
who have honored us with your presence,

09:03.417 --> 09:05.586
the 2024 Korean Enterprises Federation…

09:05.670 --> 09:07.797
- Excuse--
- It won't be long. Please cooperate.

09:07.880 --> 09:10.967
Entry is not permitted
unless you've been preapproved.

09:11.050 --> 09:14.554
Either get the organizer's approval
or wait here until the event ends.

09:16.931 --> 09:21.394
Even through the immense waves of change,
you have protected South Korea's economic…

09:21.477 --> 09:22.687
Sir!

09:24.647 --> 09:27.316
- Why haven't you gone in yet?
- What did you find out?

09:30.486 --> 09:32.029
Sarah Kim was telling the truth.

09:32.697 --> 09:35.449
Construction was underway
until a few days ago, apparently.

09:35.950 --> 09:38.369
But everything has been torn down now.

09:38.452 --> 09:41.998
Both the build-out and the tear-down
are impossible without Choi's approval.

09:43.666 --> 09:45.835
But I don't understand.
Why would Choi do that?

09:45.918 --> 09:48.212
She must have a reason for it.

09:48.921 --> 09:50.923
What brings you here?

09:52.008 --> 09:52.967
Oh, hello.

09:54.802 --> 09:56.429
Is my father inside?

09:56.512 --> 09:58.139
Are you meeting the assemblyman?

10:00.349 --> 10:02.018
I guess I am.

10:03.686 --> 10:06.272
I have something important
to discuss with my father.

10:06.772 --> 10:09.191
Do you think I can get inside?

10:12.153 --> 10:13.070
Just a moment.

10:16.574 --> 10:18.242
We will now begin the 2024…

10:18.326 --> 10:19.452
Please, come in.

10:19.535 --> 10:21.579
Sir, we got in. Come on.

10:22.580 --> 10:24.081
To victory!

10:24.582 --> 10:26.542
To victory!

10:26.626 --> 10:29.045
To victory!

10:29.128 --> 10:30.588
The assemblyman is over there.

10:31.339 --> 10:33.257
Sir, I'll just speak to my father.

10:36.218 --> 10:38.387
I'm counting on you this year, Chairwoman.

10:38.471 --> 10:39.597
- Likewise.
- Yes.

10:40.765 --> 10:42.808
I look forward to everything, Chairman.

10:43.517 --> 10:45.936
- Lovely ambiance today.
- I appreciate your support.

10:47.480 --> 10:48.856
How did you get in?

10:48.939 --> 10:51.317
This might take a while,
so let's talk elsewhere.

10:52.151 --> 10:53.110
This is no place--

10:53.194 --> 10:54.904
It's no place to discuss

10:54.987 --> 10:58.866
the allegations of evidence tampering
against the head of a major corporation.

10:59.367 --> 11:00.284
Shall I go on?

11:04.163 --> 11:05.539
Say hello to Mr. Lee here.

11:05.623 --> 11:06.540
This is my son.

11:07.124 --> 11:08.876
This way, Chairman.

11:10.586 --> 11:12.171
- It's a pleasure.
- Come this way.

11:12.254 --> 11:13.089
This is my son.

11:13.172 --> 11:14.006
- Is it?
- Yes.

11:14.090 --> 11:16.592
- Good job!
- He joined the National Police Agency.

11:29.563 --> 11:30.940
Did Sarah Kim give you that?

11:33.442 --> 11:36.821
This is the only one in the country,
here on my special order.

11:36.904 --> 11:38.572
No one can have this but me.

11:41.409 --> 11:43.244
You had even signed a contract.

11:43.828 --> 11:45.287
So why did you lie?

11:45.371 --> 11:49.291
Were you the one
who had the security footage erased?

11:49.959 --> 11:52.253
What in the world did Sarah Kim do

11:52.753 --> 11:54.088
for you to go this far?

11:55.464 --> 11:57.842
You think this is because of Sarah Kim?

11:58.843 --> 12:00.761
You did this!

12:00.845 --> 12:04.306
I didn't even know she'd conned me
until you came to see me!

12:08.978 --> 12:11.647
I never thought
she would dare drag a corpse

12:11.731 --> 12:13.274
through my department store!

12:14.275 --> 12:16.736
I was protecting my store, not her!

12:16.819 --> 12:19.321
Because that is my position and my duty.

12:19.405 --> 12:20.489
"Drag a corpse"?

12:21.240 --> 12:23.117
So you've seen the footage?

12:39.508 --> 12:41.552
Replace the entire security system.

12:41.635 --> 12:43.596
And tear down the Boudoir shop at once.

12:43.679 --> 12:47.975
Erasing it unknowingly is negligent.
Doing it after watching it is intentional.

12:48.476 --> 12:50.394
But how will you prove that?

12:51.687 --> 12:55.649
The footage is long gone.
How would you prove that?

13:02.782 --> 13:04.408
I will help you

13:04.492 --> 13:07.620
if you want to protect your store,
not Sarah Kim.

13:10.414 --> 13:12.082
Look at you, making threats.

13:13.083 --> 13:16.921
Inspector Park Mu-gyeong,
you're much scarier than I thought.

13:17.004 --> 13:18.923
I'm just saying we should make a deal.

13:26.138 --> 13:27.598
Now this is a deal.

13:30.184 --> 13:34.313
If a word of this is leaked to the press,
you're finished, Detective.

13:47.076 --> 13:50.496
Were you the final target
of Sarah Kim's con?

13:50.579 --> 13:51.747
"Final"?

13:54.250 --> 13:56.210
You really don't know anything, do you?

13:58.254 --> 14:00.798
Sarah Kim targeted me from the very start.

14:01.799 --> 14:05.177
She made everything happen
just to get to me.

14:25.573 --> 14:26.615
Excuse me.

14:27.867 --> 14:30.578
I want to propose a brand
for your luxury brand section.

14:31.078 --> 14:34.415
Would it be possible to speak
with the highest-ranking person here?

14:34.498 --> 14:35.958
Please come this way.

14:39.670 --> 14:41.505
Would you have a seat?

14:55.519 --> 14:56.604
Hello.

15:01.400 --> 15:02.693
"Bu-du-i-ir"?

15:02.776 --> 15:04.403
It's Boudoir.

15:07.114 --> 15:08.449
I'll pass this on for you.

15:08.532 --> 15:12.661
Chief Director Park Sun-bok
will be with you shortly.

15:13.954 --> 15:16.665
- Please bring this lady a drink.
- Yes, ma'am.

15:29.136 --> 15:32.056
THE AUTOBIOGRAPHY OF CHOI CHAE-U
JOURNEY

15:37.269 --> 15:40.189
LIFE IS A SERIES OF MISTAKES AND LESSONS
TO THOSE STARTING A GREAT JOURNEY

16:03.253 --> 16:06.256
- I'm heading out. Take care.
- Good night.

16:06.340 --> 16:09.885
Excuse me, but will it be much longer
for Chief Director Park Sun-bok?

16:10.636 --> 16:12.096
There's no one by that name.

16:19.228 --> 16:20.896
PARK SUN-BOK GUKBAP

16:24.316 --> 16:26.735
I was too hasty.

16:28.487 --> 16:31.073
I was too hasty.

16:40.874 --> 16:42.251
KANG JI-HWON
I NEED YOUR HELP

16:42.334 --> 16:44.837
I'm going to get Boudoir
into Samwol Department Store.

16:45.587 --> 16:48.799
I want to take it slow,
even if it takes time.

16:53.178 --> 16:56.807
For now, I need an ally to get close
to Choi Chae-u and help me get intel.

16:58.600 --> 16:59.601
Wait a minute.

17:01.687 --> 17:03.313
Are you suggesting I do that?

17:04.314 --> 17:06.191
You said she came by the host bar.

17:06.275 --> 17:09.737
Yes, she did. But that was only once.

17:09.820 --> 17:13.824
And in person,
she's someone on a whole different level.

17:13.907 --> 17:15.743
Eun-jae, no. I can't do it.

17:16.952 --> 17:19.496
One of my regular clingy clients
is a Samwol executive.

17:19.580 --> 17:23.292
She's even a chief director.
I'll connect you with her instead.

17:23.375 --> 17:25.002
No, it has to be you.

17:26.170 --> 17:28.213
The one thing she could never have
is youth.

17:30.174 --> 17:33.177
She said the one thing
she could never be is a man.

17:33.969 --> 17:37.014
To her, I bet a young man
is the most desirable thing in the world.

17:43.187 --> 17:44.146
Notable details?

17:44.730 --> 17:45.773
You must like it.

17:46.690 --> 17:47.983
Cognac, I mean.

17:48.984 --> 17:50.402
I've never tried it.

17:51.153 --> 17:51.987
Blowing money!

17:52.946 --> 17:56.700
She collects Richard Hennessy
even though she doesn't drink it.

17:57.951 --> 18:00.245
You must be in the middle
of a VIP gathering.

18:00.329 --> 18:02.831
- Hello, Chairwoman.
- Who were you again?

18:14.676 --> 18:17.262
Choi Chae-u doesn't trust anyone.

18:17.930 --> 18:20.390
She always leaves her phone behind
when she steps away.

18:20.474 --> 18:22.142
Did you all hear?

18:22.226 --> 18:27.147
Apparently, Sarah Kim got completely drunk
at the club lounge and broke an Opale.

18:27.231 --> 18:31.819
I heard she went to Chanel
and pulled the "I'll take it all."

18:31.902 --> 18:33.278
Like some nouveau riche.

18:33.362 --> 18:35.447
But honestly,
Chanel isn't really our style.

18:35.531 --> 18:37.491
Chairwoman Choi was in Chanel again today.

18:37.574 --> 18:40.035
- She does like her Chanel.
- I know.

18:40.119 --> 18:41.787
It's Chanel that likes me.

18:42.287 --> 18:43.455
The pop culture scene now

18:43.539 --> 18:46.500
is split into those who have a Boudoir bag
and those who don't.

18:47.292 --> 18:49.336
Chairwoman Choi is slowly on her way down.

18:49.419 --> 18:52.339
Oh, here comes the "Human Chanel."
Smile, everyone.

18:56.218 --> 18:58.387
Where is this Boudoir? Take me there.

18:58.470 --> 18:59.930
Yes, ma'am.

19:03.559 --> 19:05.811
You're Sarah Kim?

19:09.398 --> 19:10.858
You're not like what I've heard.

19:10.941 --> 19:11.859
Pardon?

19:12.901 --> 19:14.194
Don't worry about it.

19:15.737 --> 19:16.947
Where's the restroom?

19:17.948 --> 19:21.201
- Let me escort you.
- Don't. I'm not some frail old lady.

19:21.952 --> 19:22.953
This way, please.

19:34.089 --> 19:36.049
Chaebols aren't all that special.

19:36.133 --> 19:38.510
Drinking in broad daylight
and throwing up like that.

19:39.011 --> 19:42.222
I wouldn't want to end up like that,
no matter how much money I had.

19:42.306 --> 19:44.349
You could never end up like that.

19:44.433 --> 19:47.144
You can't become a chaebol
just because you want to.

19:49.688 --> 19:50.939
So watch your mouth.

19:51.523 --> 19:54.484
Selling high-class goods
doesn't make you high-class.

19:54.568 --> 19:56.111
I'm sorry.

19:58.238 --> 20:00.699
The first and last person
to pass that test

20:00.782 --> 20:02.743
was MD Chief Director Kim Hong-mi.

20:02.826 --> 20:06.121
That fast-tracked her from division head
to managing director.

20:06.205 --> 20:07.706
Excuse me, ma'am.

20:07.789 --> 20:09.333
May I check your queue number?

20:10.375 --> 20:12.336
I'm here for your regional head.

20:13.378 --> 20:16.006
She is currently in a meeting.

20:16.506 --> 20:18.300
Would you mind waiting in the store?

20:31.063 --> 20:33.774
Ms. Kim is still in a meeting.

20:38.487 --> 20:40.447
- Good work, everyone.
- Thank you.

20:40.530 --> 20:41.698
She's over there.

20:45.160 --> 20:46.536
I'm sorry to keep you waiting.

20:48.538 --> 20:50.040
It wasn't too bad.

20:51.250 --> 20:53.001
That's a relief, then.

20:55.128 --> 20:56.588
Why did you want to see me?

21:05.055 --> 21:08.350
We'd like to invite you to open
at the Samwol Gangnam branch.

21:10.644 --> 21:11.603
How interesting.

21:17.317 --> 21:18.360
There are many terms.

21:19.403 --> 21:22.114
Exclusive rights
and a hefty 15% commission.

21:23.657 --> 21:27.327
I was at London Fashion Week
a few days ago.

21:28.245 --> 21:29.413
It was odd,

21:29.913 --> 21:34.960
but no one there seemed to know
anything about Boudoir.

21:39.756 --> 21:42.092
Perhaps those you met were unqualified.

21:44.845 --> 21:46.013
Perhaps.

21:47.597 --> 21:52.060
We request that you submit
company review documents, just in case.

21:52.728 --> 21:54.187
Working out the details

21:54.980 --> 21:57.190
can proceed after that.

22:01.695 --> 22:03.739
Boudoir is considering Samwol.

22:04.239 --> 22:06.575
Not the other way around.

22:09.036 --> 22:12.247
We can't sign on these terms,
so come back with a revised contract.

22:15.751 --> 22:18.378
We've asked Boudoir to provide
company review documents,

22:18.462 --> 22:21.340
but they keep delaying
and refuse to submit them.

22:22.049 --> 22:24.384
There's also that client data leak,

22:24.468 --> 22:28.597
and Sarah Kim's reputation
hasn't been great lately either.

22:29.097 --> 22:30.682
I heard about that too.

22:31.224 --> 22:33.602
A trusting relationship
doesn't seem sustainable.

22:33.685 --> 22:35.187
She seems to have many faces.

22:35.270 --> 22:37.939
I don't know how she is with you, ma'am,
but with me…

22:38.023 --> 22:39.983
She's right to have many faces.

22:40.067 --> 22:43.195
She obviously can't treat you
the same way she treats me.

22:45.322 --> 22:46.281
No, she can't.

22:46.782 --> 22:48.116
Then what's the problem?

22:49.076 --> 22:50.952
Propose a 10% commission to Boudoir.

22:52.162 --> 22:52.996
Yes, ma'am.

23:15.310 --> 23:16.686
Sarah Kim?

23:29.741 --> 23:32.244
Fancy seeing you here. Are you here alone?

23:32.953 --> 23:33.787
Yes.

23:37.040 --> 23:40.710
I'm spending today with Richard Hennessy.
Beats any human company.

23:41.586 --> 23:43.171
I guess you don't trust people.

23:45.090 --> 23:47.300
With two people, you end up crying.

23:47.926 --> 23:50.262
With three, you end up fighting.

23:50.762 --> 23:53.557
With any more than that,
you end up feeling lonely.

23:54.474 --> 23:56.643
You appeared lonely
even when you were alone.

24:00.397 --> 24:02.441
I lost an employee I cared about.

24:03.567 --> 24:06.695
She secretly sold client information
to an insurance company.

24:07.404 --> 24:08.405
I heard.

24:08.905 --> 24:11.950
That you covered up their mistake
and protected the employee.

24:12.701 --> 24:14.035
But be stern when necessary.

24:16.204 --> 24:18.331
I'm not that nice a person.

24:19.624 --> 24:22.210
I had to give up on the employee
to protect the brand.

24:23.795 --> 24:26.798
We really do have a lot in common.

24:30.552 --> 24:31.803
The problem is…

24:33.430 --> 24:35.932
that one thing made me doubt everything.

24:37.267 --> 24:39.311
I can't trust anyone anymore.

24:39.811 --> 24:42.063
It's not people we can't trust.

24:42.147 --> 24:43.356
It's their promises.

24:48.612 --> 24:53.992
As a token of their promise,
the two of them each took a key,

24:54.075 --> 24:57.662
since you need two keys turned at once
to open a Richard Hennessy.

24:57.746 --> 25:00.665
They promised to return
and share the bottle together.

25:02.000 --> 25:03.084
But

25:03.627 --> 25:06.254
the promise was never kept.

25:14.095 --> 25:15.680
I'm sorry.

25:18.058 --> 25:19.935
I must decline your offer to join Samwol.

25:21.645 --> 25:24.814
Please understand I never broke a promise,
as I never made one.

25:25.440 --> 25:26.358
Your reason?

25:26.983 --> 25:29.861
The Mirae has offered
to take a lower commission.

25:30.820 --> 25:33.448
Personally, my relationship with you
comes first.

25:33.532 --> 25:35.575
But professionally, profits come first.

25:37.327 --> 25:39.663
I understand.
That's what a businesswoman does.

25:44.918 --> 25:45.877
Chairwoman Choi.

25:46.795 --> 25:49.089
May I say something
as your drinking friend

25:49.172 --> 25:50.799
and not as a businesswoman?

25:52.133 --> 25:55.971
It may be an unfounded concern,
but something feels amiss.

25:56.513 --> 25:59.391
As soon as Samwol offered
a 10% commission rate,

25:59.891 --> 26:02.143
The Mirae came to me with 9%.

26:03.228 --> 26:05.897
It may be wise to check

26:06.606 --> 26:08.483
for internal information leaks.

26:12.571 --> 26:15.615
The only one who would even know
the details of the contract…

26:17.200 --> 26:18.785
is Chief Director Kim Hong-mi.

26:20.287 --> 26:21.204
Am I right?

26:35.552 --> 26:37.554
You ought to be stern when necessary.

26:51.192 --> 26:52.986
Why did you get off work so late?

26:57.616 --> 26:58.825
Kim Hong-mi

26:59.409 --> 27:00.869
was forced to resign.

27:02.621 --> 27:06.082
And Choi Chae-u is reacting hysterically
because of it.

27:06.166 --> 27:07.917
Not a disciplinary dismissal?

27:11.463 --> 27:13.340
She's surprisingly soft-hearted.

27:17.844 --> 27:19.304
Do you know you've changed?

27:20.930 --> 27:22.766
Why are you this obsessed with Samwol?

27:23.350 --> 27:25.185
For me, it has to be that space.

27:36.279 --> 27:37.322
How do you like it?

27:43.787 --> 27:45.955
October 14th. Who closed up that day?

27:57.050 --> 27:58.593
It's just as I had imagined.

27:59.844 --> 28:02.764
If you agree,
we'll begin the interior work right away.

28:02.847 --> 28:05.600
We will handle all the expenses.

28:12.524 --> 28:14.609
Do you still have concerns?

28:15.276 --> 28:17.737
I'm thinking of ways
to persuade headquarters.

28:20.073 --> 28:21.449
Headquarters…

28:21.950 --> 28:25.704
They've had a complete change of heart
due to Samwol's attitude.

28:27.080 --> 28:28.998
We've had countless offers in the past,

28:29.499 --> 28:32.127
but we've never been asked to submit
to a company review.

28:32.711 --> 28:35.630
Even so, we can't ignore procedure.

28:35.714 --> 28:38.633
Yes. Please think it over and let me know.

28:39.259 --> 28:42.387
But I'm afraid we can't wait too long.

28:42.887 --> 28:44.931
We need to finish our talks
with The Mirae.

28:49.602 --> 28:51.104
Do you mind if I look around?

29:04.659 --> 29:08.288
Ma'am. Apparently,
there was a disturbance in the VIP lounge.

29:09.038 --> 29:11.166
But why did I need to be informed?

29:11.666 --> 29:12.834
Is it someone I know?

29:15.128 --> 29:16.129
Well…

29:17.130 --> 29:18.798
They say it was Sarah Kim.

29:36.107 --> 29:36.983
Dear,

29:37.859 --> 29:42.238
did you ever break an Opale
at the hotel lounge before?

29:43.072 --> 29:44.032
No.

29:44.699 --> 29:45.950
Just as I thought.

29:46.034 --> 29:47.660
It's all that woman's doing.

29:48.578 --> 29:49.412
Sorry?

29:49.913 --> 29:51.998
I had something like this before.

29:52.081 --> 29:55.585
That you were going around
acting like some obnoxious nouveau riche.

29:55.668 --> 29:57.962
That means this has happened
many times before.

29:59.130 --> 30:02.467
Imitating someone like that
is a form of mental illness.

30:02.550 --> 30:05.178
How pathetic and miserable
do you have to be

30:05.261 --> 30:06.930
to steal someone else's life?

30:07.013 --> 30:08.932
All you'll ever be is an imitation.

30:11.100 --> 30:13.603
Your profile isn't even
on the web portals, is it?

30:14.479 --> 30:16.773
People put their faces up there
for a good reason.

30:16.856 --> 30:19.150
This sort of thing happens all too often.

30:19.651 --> 30:21.402
I'll tell them to do it right away.

30:21.486 --> 30:23.071
No, it's all right.

30:23.154 --> 30:24.364
Please don't worry.

30:24.447 --> 30:27.075
Security has the impostor in custody.

30:27.158 --> 30:29.702
We'll hand them to the police,
so don't worry.

30:29.786 --> 30:31.704
Honestly, it's really fine.

30:36.251 --> 30:38.503
I'm sorry. I guess I'm quite shocked.

30:40.296 --> 30:43.132
I'll deal with this myself.
Don't worry about it.

30:43.216 --> 30:46.469
How could I not,
especially when it happened in my store?

30:46.553 --> 30:48.888
If I end up owing you
before signing the contract,

30:49.472 --> 30:51.266
it'll be awkward for both of us.

30:53.685 --> 30:54.769
That is true, but…

30:54.853 --> 30:56.604
You'd be helping me

30:57.480 --> 30:58.815
by not helping me.

30:59.315 --> 31:01.985
It's not that she didn't report it,
but that she couldn't.

31:02.068 --> 31:04.696
Her identity would have been revealed
if she had.

31:05.780 --> 31:08.783
I never doubted her,
even in obviously suspicious moments.

31:09.409 --> 31:11.619
She appeared to have a life

31:11.703 --> 31:14.497
desirable enough for someone
to want to impersonate her.

31:16.082 --> 31:18.376
I had no idea
she had covered my eyes and ears

31:18.459 --> 31:21.004
and pushed out my people.

31:21.504 --> 31:23.840
An excellent con is never discovered

31:24.382 --> 31:26.926
because you don't even realize
you've been conned.

31:27.427 --> 31:28.803
Yes, you're right.

31:29.304 --> 31:31.598
Seeing as how she fooled me until the end.

31:32.807 --> 31:35.184
That bitch really is something else.

31:36.811 --> 31:39.606
I was convinced
the moment I set foot in that party.

31:40.189 --> 31:42.650
A company review didn't matter.

31:51.951 --> 31:52.911
That's right!

31:53.411 --> 31:55.246
She was there too.

31:55.747 --> 31:56.831
That impersonator.

31:57.916 --> 32:00.293
She was wearing
exactly the same hairstyle and dress.

32:02.754 --> 32:04.047
Chairwoman Choi.

32:04.130 --> 32:05.548
We meet again.

32:05.632 --> 32:06.966
Indeed.

32:12.388 --> 32:15.099
She was caught
on the store's security footage.

32:16.434 --> 32:18.853
That woman killed Sarah Kim.

32:22.273 --> 32:24.108
Sarah Kim is alive.

32:31.282 --> 32:33.660
Which Sarah Kim are you talking about?

32:35.995 --> 32:38.414
- The dead woman impersonated Sarah Kim.
- What?

32:38.498 --> 32:39.874
There were two Sarah Kims.

32:39.958 --> 32:42.877
And Choi was the last person
to see the two together.

32:42.961 --> 32:43.836
Call in CSI.

33:01.145 --> 33:03.189
The security cameras are cut clean.

33:03.940 --> 33:04.941
God.

33:06.192 --> 33:07.986
They made a total mess in here.

33:08.486 --> 33:11.239
Just how far
does the blood on the floor go?

33:11.322 --> 33:15.743
So after being hit there, they fell and…

33:18.246 --> 33:19.747
It's a mark made by a weapon.

33:27.130 --> 33:28.256
VICTIM'S DRESS MADE BY MORPHÉ

33:28.339 --> 33:31.009
Both women wore the same dress
on the day of the murder.

33:31.509 --> 33:36.014
She had two identical dresses made before
and disabled the security cameras.

33:36.097 --> 33:37.473
This murder was planned.

33:37.557 --> 33:39.559
We can prove she was preparing
for the crime

33:40.143 --> 33:41.853
if we can confirm she was the buyer.

33:41.936 --> 33:43.062
It's too sloppy.

33:43.563 --> 33:45.398
Do you think someone that meticulous

33:45.481 --> 33:48.317
would just leave behind
such important evidence?

33:50.528 --> 33:51.654
What do you think?

33:51.738 --> 33:52.780
Just a moment.

33:57.243 --> 33:59.037
This dress is from here, right?

33:59.704 --> 34:01.497
Yes, I made that dress.

34:01.998 --> 34:03.833
Do you remember who bought it?

34:04.333 --> 34:05.168
Yes.

34:05.251 --> 34:07.795
She's our boutique regular.

34:07.879 --> 34:08.713
Sarah Kim.

34:13.468 --> 34:14.719
How does the waist feel?

34:14.802 --> 34:16.262
It was an unusual order.

34:16.345 --> 34:19.766
She wanted me to make
two of the same dress.

34:19.849 --> 34:22.477
- No security cameras in the store?
- No.

34:23.644 --> 34:26.105
Clients usually have several fittings,

34:26.606 --> 34:28.691
and tailoring takes a long time too.

34:34.489 --> 34:38.284
Do you still have
the pins you used for tailoring?

35:02.683 --> 35:04.185
FORENSIC REPORT

35:06.062 --> 35:08.106
DNA ANALYSIS INDICATES A 99.99998% MATCH

35:08.189 --> 35:10.066
What's taking so long?

35:11.359 --> 35:12.360
Oh, that scared me.

35:12.860 --> 35:13.861
It's here.

35:18.616 --> 35:20.618
The DNA matches.
Let's get the warrant now.

35:20.701 --> 35:22.537
- Okay!
- It's not Sarah Kim.

35:23.121 --> 35:24.997
Neither the prints nor the blood matches.

35:25.706 --> 35:27.959
What are you saying? Then what's this?

35:28.042 --> 35:30.294
We compared it to the victim's.

35:31.420 --> 35:32.296
What?

35:37.385 --> 35:39.011
Be careful, would you?

35:39.095 --> 35:42.223
Do you know what kinds of people
con artists usually target?

35:42.306 --> 35:43.599
Stupid people?

35:43.683 --> 35:45.059
Incredibly vain people?

35:45.560 --> 35:49.272
No. If anything, they're intellectuals
with expert knowledge.

35:49.814 --> 35:51.065
The more expert they are,

35:51.149 --> 35:53.609
the more adamantly they believe
they can't be fooled.

35:54.610 --> 35:55.695
Be careful.

35:56.195 --> 35:57.613
I'm talking about you.

35:58.865 --> 36:00.575
The perfect con.

36:01.868 --> 36:04.704
Sarah Kim chose me for the perfect con.

37:46.055 --> 37:51.060
Subtitle Translation by: Yung Un Choi
